Modifications made by this project relative to the original SOC-CMM®
materials include (non-exhaustive list):

  - Implementation of a web-based assessment workflow (FastAPI + SQLite)
  - Translation of questions and guidance into Portuguese (PT-BR)
  - Bilingual user interface (EN / PT-BR)
  - Multi-tenant user authentication and customer scoping
  - REST API and Model Context Protocol (MCP) server integrations
  - Visual reporting (radar charts, progress over time)

